{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789228513243,"sessionID":"ses_f69abb172ffeDarDKAA7BOMHKQ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"skill","callID":"call_1fd6c35074c14e8a9f7c4ca1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"name":"math-notes"},"output":"<skill_content name=\"math-notes\">\n# Skill: math-notes\n\n# 數學實驗筆記\n\n先讀使用者指定的程式、結果與既有筆記，再整理這次任務。\n\n- 筆記寫清楚研究問題、符號與必要假設，再說明做了什麼、看到什麼。\n- 公式使用 Markdown 的 $...$ 與 $$...$$。沒有解釋過的符號要先定義。\n- 結果註明來源檔案與實際執行指令；沒有執行輸出時，標明只有程式可讀。\n- 保留原始數字與結論的適用範圍。分開寫已觀察結果、推論與尚未確認的事。\n- 以學生可以自己回答的一個檢查問題收尾，答案另列。\n- 依使用者指定路徑存檔；若檔案已存在，先讀內容再更新。不要為了寫筆記另做實驗。\n\nBase directory for this skill: C:\\Users\\User\\Documents\\ai-math-refresh-20260912\\agent-workflow-auto\\.opencode\\skills\\math-notes\nRelative paths in this skill (e.g., scripts/, reference/) are relative to this base directory.\nNote: file list is sampled.\n\n<skill_files>\n\n</skill_files>\n</skill_content>","metadata":{"name":"math-notes","dir":"C:\\Users\\User\\Documents\\ai-math-refresh-20260912\\agent-workflow-auto\\.opencode\\skills\\math-notes","truncated":false},"title":"Loaded skill: math-notes","time":{"start":1789228513205,"end":1789228513236}},"id":"prt_09654774e001bLnfsw7oIxLaJY","sessionID":"ses_f69abb172ffeDarDKAA7BOMHKQ","messageID":"msg_096545050001u5MItpITbmuCXG"}}
